{title: PONY MAN (The) (In A)}
{subtitle: Gordon Lightfoot}
Going from (A) to (Dsus4) is a tad tricky.  Simply play (D) and add your pinky to the 1st string/3rd fret.  The (E) (Esus) (E) trill is easier; just play (E) and add your pinky under your ring finger on the third string/2nd fret while keeping your index finger where it is.  Remove the pinky to get back to (E).  Or skip both the (Dsus4) and (Esus) and just play (D) and (E) if you want.

